  id: journal.maps
  title: "Know Where You Are"
  author: "Cartographer J. Lindqvist"
  dateLine: "Field note, landing zone 1"
  category: 0
  body: "M opens the surface map, and N opens the dig site plans; both are tabs in the same window. The game pauses while it's open.\n\nThe surface map shows the landing zones and every signature you've scanned. The dig site plans show each fenced site's flags, which spots you've finished, and which are still unfinished. Check them before you dig, not after."
